# Magnesium, hexagonal close-packed (P6_3/mmc), 2 atoms, at the experimental lattice (a = 3.2094, c = 5.2108 Ang,
# room temperature). c along z, a along x: the standard orientation of a hexagonal elastic tensor. Used in README
# section 5.9 with the MACE-MP-0 foundation model (the fine-tuned model of 5.1 knows only silicon).
NumberOfSpecies 1
NumberOfAtoms 2
%block ChemicalSpeciesLabel
 1 12 Mg
%endblock ChemicalSpeciesLabel
LatticeConstant 1.0 Ang
%block LatticeVectors
  3.20940000  0.00000000  0.00000000
 -1.60470000  2.77942193  0.00000000
  0.00000000  0.00000000  5.21080000
%endblock LatticeVectors
AtomicCoordinatesFormat Fractional
%block AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
 0.33333333 0.66666667 0.25000000 1
 0.66666667 0.33333333 0.75000000 1
%endblock AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
